        <activityName xml:lang="en">Silencer, steel, DN 315, 50 mm, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Silencer, steel, DN 315, 50 mm, at plant
Production of a typical component used for a ventilation system in a multi family house. The house considered in the investigation includes 6 flats with 130 m2 floor area each and a ventilation rate of 120 m3/h.;
UUID: a80fe3b2-9127-3477-90e2-83b8c92d191b
&lt;null&gt;
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Silencer made of galvanised steel with 50 mm glass wool for acoustic insulation. Weight of element 20 kg
Time period: Materials investigated in 2003
Production volume: na
Sampling: Sampling procedure: Questionnaire and technical information of producer. Data of one common product used. 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_a80fe3b2-9127-3477-90e2-83b8c92d191b.xml</text>
